-- 062_backfill_supplier_products.sql
--
-- Enrich product rows for suppliers with a live Shopify product feed, using
-- each supplier's own catalogue data:
--
--   MetaBev (46)            — brand copy from their product feed, re-applied at
--                             the 40-50 word description standard.
--   That Wine Co (20)       — structured spec sheets (Region / Alcohol / Grapes /
--                             Body-Sweetness-Tannins-Acidity) and no prose, so the
--                             description is composed from those facts.
--   Cellarmaster Wines (10) — brand copy paragraphs (award/heading noise stripped).
--
-- Descriptions are capped at ~48 words and always end on a sentence boundary.
-- Only fields the feed actually provides are set; nothing is invented.
-- Generated by scripts/backfill_supplier_products.py — DO NOT hand-edit.
--
-- Scope note: only drinks the supplier has actually listed (within their plan
-- entitlement) are touched — this never adds products on the supplier's behalf.
--
-- Run in Supabase SQL Editor: https://kktlbznmhxaortogqspy.supabase.co


-- ============================================================
-- MetaBev — www.meta-bev.com
-- ============================================================

